# Canyon Crab: only a spell Bot1 cast from their hand stops the end-step loot. On turn one Bot1 casts Think Twice from hand (so no
# trigger at that end step); on turn three they cast it again with flashback from the graveyard ({2}{U}, three Mox Sapphires) and
# in response to the end-step trigger Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at them: neither is a spell Bot1 cast from their hand, so the
# trigger resolves and loots (draw, discard) despite both.

[Bot1 Deck]
Canyon Crab
Think Twice
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Island
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x13

