Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Canyon Crab.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#4.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Think Twice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
